    !---------------------------------------------
    !>     \brief  BLAS Level 1 API
    !>
    !>     \details
    !>     The copyBatched functions copy each element x_i[j] into y_i[j], for ``j`` = 1 , ... ,
    !>     ``n``; ``i`` = 1 , ... , ``batchCount``.
    !>
    !>         y_i := x_i,
    !>
    !>     where (``x_i``, ``y_i``) is the ``i``-th instance of the batch.
    !>     ``x_i`` and ``y_i`` are vectors.
    !>
