    !>     @param[in] x - device array of device pointers storing each vector x_i.
    !>     @param[in] incx - [int]
    !>               specifies the increment for the elements of each vector x_i.
    !>     @param[out] y - device array of device pointers storing each vector y_i.
    !>     @param[in] incy - [int]
