    !---------------------------------------------
    ! hipblasChemvBatched
    !---------------------------------------------
    !>     \brief  BLAS Level 2 API
    !>
    !>     \details
    !>     The hemvBatched functions perform one of the matrix-vector operations:
    !>
    !>         y_i := alpha*A_i*x_i + beta*y_i
    !>
    !>     where ``alpha`` and ``beta`` are scalars, ``x_i`` and ``y_i`` are ``n`` -element vectors,
    !>     and ``A_i`` is an
    !>     ``n`` by ``n`` Hermitian matrix, for each batch in ``i = [1, batchCount``].
    !>
    !>     - Supported precisions in rocBLAS : ``c`` and ``z``.
    !>     - Supported precisions in cuBLAS  : No support.
    !>
    !>     @param[in] handle - [hipblasHandle_t]
    !>               handle to the hipBLAS library context queue.
    !>     @param[in] uplo - [hipblasFillMode_t]
    !>               - HIPBLAS_FILL_MODE_UPPER: the upper triangular part of the Hermitian matrix A
    !>               is supplied.
    !>               - HIPBLAS_FILL_MODE_LOWER: the lower triangular part of the Hermitian matrix A
    !>               is supplied.
    !>     @param[in] n - [int]
