  !>               specifies the form of op( A ).
  !>     @param[in] transB - [hipblasOperation_t]
  !>               specifies the form of op( B ).
  !>     @param[in] m - [int]
  !>               matrix dimension m.
  !>     @param[in] n - [int]
  !>               matrix dimension n.
  !>     @param[in] alpha - device pointer or host pointer specifying the scalar alpha.
